                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e3eba0b4-9302-4fd3-86b2-b2bfd1fa53d6",
                                "sense_id": "64853a38-03eb-33a1-97cd-ab6eba38f307",
                                "text": "Therfoꝛe thus ſaieth the holy one of Iſrael: In as moch as ye haue caſt of youre bewtie, and confoꝛted youre ſelues with power and nymbleneſſe, and put youre confidence therin: therfoꝛe ſhal ye haue this myſchefe agayne foꝛ youre deſtruction and fall, like as an hie wall, that falleth becauſe of ſome rift (oꝛ blaſt,) whoſe bꝛeakinge cometh ſodenly."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3123b2d5-bf1e-49ee-96f3-034daa55fbde",
                                "sense_id": "64853a38-03eb-33a1-97cd-ab6eba38f307",
                                "text": "'Tis better that the Enemie ſeeke vs,\nSo ſhall he waſte his meanes, weary his Souldiers,\nDoing himſelfe offence, whil'ſt we lying ſtill,\nAre full of reſt, defence, and nimbleneſſe."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
